  "summary": "The paper implements gate-based quantum circuits for option pricing using amplitude estimation, demonstrating simulations for vanilla, basket, Asian, and barrier options and a 3‑qubit hardware proof-of-concept on IBM Q Tokyo. Hardware experiments used 8192 shots repeated 20 times and an optimized circuit with 18 CNOT and 33 single‑qubit gates. Simulations show the expected quadratic error scaling (O(M^-1)) of amplitude estimation compared to Monte Carlo (O(M^-1/2)).",
